<body class="login-page"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden"><defs><symbol id="i-grid" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1.5"/></symbol><symbol id="i-building" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 21V5l9-2v18M13 9h7v12M2 21h20M7 8h2M7 12h2M7 16h2M16 12h1M16 16h1"/></symbol><symbol id="i-clipboard" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="m8 13 2 2 5-5M8 18h7"/></symbol><symbol id="i-spark" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 3 2.4 6.6L21 12l-6.6 2.4L12 21l-2.4-6.6L3 12l6.6-2.4L12 3ZM20 3v4M18 5h4"/></symbol><symbol id="i-chart" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 3v17h17M8 16v-5M13 16V7M18 16V4"/></symbol><symbol id="i-file" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9l-6-6ZM14 3v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></symbol><symbol id="i-clock" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></symbol><symbol id="i-logout" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 4H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4M14 8l4 4-4 4M8 12h13"/></symbol><symbol id="i-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12h16M14 6l6 6-6 6"/></symbol><symbol id="i-chevron" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"/></symbol><symbol id="i-plus" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></symbol><symbol id="i-search" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></symbol><symbol id="i-menu" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/></symbol><symbol id="i-eye" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></symbol><symbol id="i-lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="10" width="14" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3M12 14v3"/></symbol><symbol id="i-logo" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19V9M10 19V5M16 19v-8M22 19V2"/></symbol></defs></svg>
<main class="login-layout"><section class="login-story"><a class="sdg-brand" href="login.jsp" aria-label="Decisión"><span class="brand-mark"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-logo"/></svg></span><span><span class="brand-name">Decisión</span><span class="brand-sub">Gestión empresarial</span></span></a><div class="login-story-main"><span class="login-kicker">Una visión integral de tu negocio</span><h1>Información clara.<br><span>Decisiones con dirección.</span></h1><p>Conoce el estado de tu empresa, identifica oportunidades y da el siguiente paso con una mejor perspectiva.</p><div class="login-art" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div><p class="login-story-footer">Evaluación y apoyo a las decisiones gerenciales · MYPES</p></section>
<section class="login-form-panel" aria-label="Acceso al sistema"><div class="login-form-wrap"><div class="login-mobile-brand"><span class="brand-mark"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-logo"/></svg></span><strong>Decisión</strong></div><p class="page-eyebrow">Tu espacio de gestión</p><h2>Bienvenido de nuevo</h2><p class="login-intro">Ingresa a tu cuenta para continuar con la gestión y evaluación de tus empresas.</p>
<% String loginError=request.getParameter("error"); if("1".equals(loginError)){ %><div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">Usuario o contraseña incorrectos. Revisa tus datos e inténtalo nuevamente.</div><% }else if("2".equals(loginError)){ %><div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">Inicia sesión para acceder a tu espacio de trabajo.</div><% } %>
<form action="LoginServlet" method="POST"><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="usuario">Usuario</label><input class="form-control" type="text" id="usuario" name="usuario" autocomplete="username" placeholder="Ingresa tu usuario" required></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="password">Contraseña</label><div class="password-field"><input class="form-control" type="password" id="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Ingresa tu contraseña" required><button type="button" class="password-toggle" data-password-toggle aria-label="Mostrar contraseña" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-eye"/></svg></button></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary login-submit" type="submit">Iniciar sesión <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow"/></svg></button></form>
<div class="login-form-foot"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg><span>Acceso exclusivo para usuarios registrados.<br>Tu información de gestión, en un solo lugar.</span></div></div><span class="login-copyright">Sistema de Decisión Gerencial · MYPES</span></section></main>
